SUMMARY:RiseUp Karaoke - The B-Sideǃ
DESCRIPTION:RISEUP KARAOKE PRESENTS: THE B-SIDEǃ This week‚ were digging
  a little deeper. You know the big hits. The songs everybody knows. The one
 s that show up on every playlist and karaoke menu. But what about the OTHER
  songs? For THE B-SIDE‚ we want the overlooked ones. The forgotten ones. 
 The deep cuts. The other hit. The album track you think deserved to be huge
 . The song by a famous artist that somehow never gets sung. Or maybe its si
 mply your B-side - the song you keep scrolling past because theres always s
 omething safer or more familiar to sing. This week‚ give that song its tu
 rn at the mic. As always‚ the theme is inspiration‚ not homework. If th
 e song you want to sing happens to be the biggest hit of all time‚ sing i
 t anyway. All songs and singers are welcome at RiseUp. This week‚ skip th
 e obvious choice. Flip the record over and show us what weve been missing. 
 RiseUp Crew: AlongCamePolly‚ CarlosUSNRet‚ Chrysanthemumum‚ RingoSati
 re‚ SmittyJames
